rrentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D6FD\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D6FD\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>-1, 4 linkage between <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.439ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.296ex\" height=\"2.034ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -705 573 899\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D6FD\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D6FD\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>-D-glucose units. The cellulose is linear molecule.</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1000/image/1lgdwl5s6/f9494593-c618-4cc1-8558-edafd3473f81/b50df260-d94e-11ed-a430-db8c5f970635/file-1lgdwl5s7.png?format=png\" data-orsrc=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/image/1lgdwl5s6/f9494593-c618-4cc1-8558-edafd3473f81/b50df260-d94e-11ed-a430-db8c5f970635/file-1lgdwl5s7.png\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0px auto;max-height:40vh\" alt=\"IIT-JEE 2008 Paper 2 Offline Chemistry - Biomolecules Question 8 English Explanation 1\" srcset=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/500/image/1lgdwl5s6/f9494593-c618-4cc1-8558-edafd3473f81/b50df260-d94e-11ed-a430-db8c5f970635/file-1lgdwl5s7.png?format=png 500w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/750/image/1lgdwl5s6/f9494593-c618-4cc1-8558-edafd3473f81/b50df260-d94e-11ed-a430-db8c5f970635/file-1lgdwl5s7.png?format=png 750w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1000/image/1lgdwl5s6/f9494593-c618-4cc1-8558-edafd3473f81/b50df260-d94e-11ed-a430-db8c5f970635/file-1lgdwl5s7.png?format=png 1000w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1500/image/1lgdwl5s6/f9494593-c618-4cc1-8558-edafd3473f81/b50df260-d94e-11ed-a430-db8c5f970635/file-1lgdwl5s7.png?format=png 1500w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/2000/image/1lgdwl5s6/f9494593-c618-4cc1-8558-edafd3473f81/b50df260-d94e-11ed-a430-db8c5f970635/file-1lgdwl5s7.png?format=png 2000w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/2500/image/1lgdwl5s6/f9494593-c618-4cc1-8558-edafd3473f81/b50df260-d94e-11ed-a430-db8c5f970635/file-1lgdwl5s7.png?format=png 2500w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 720px\" decoding=\"async\"></p>\n<p>A general reaction of alcohol with acetic anhydride is :</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1000/image/1lgdwllln/244f9b36-e57d-49bb-a021-6ac861bc1825/c14626b0-d94e-11ed-a430-db8c5f970635/file-1lgdwlllo.png?format=png\" data-orsrc=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/image/1lgdwllln/244f9b36-e57d-49bb-a021-6ac861bc1825/c14626b0-d94e-11ed-a430-db8c5f970635/file-1lgdwlllo.png\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0px auto;max-height:40vh\" alt=\"IIT-JEE 2008 Paper 2 Offline Chemistry - Biomolecules Question 8 English Explanation 2\" srcset=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/500/image/1lgdwllln/244f9b36-e57d-49bb-a021-6ac861bc1825/c14626b0-d94e-11ed-a430-db8c5f970635/file-1lgdwlllo.png?format=png 500w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/750/image/1lgdwllln/244f9b36-e57d-49bb-a021-6ac861bc1825/c14626b0-d94e-11ed-a430-db8c5f970635/file-1lgdwlllo.png?format=png 750w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1000/image/1lgdwllln/244f9b36-e57d-49bb-a021-6ac861bc1825/c14626b0-d94e-11ed-a430-db8c5f970635/file-1lgdwlllo.png?format=png 1000w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1500/image/1lgdwllln/244f9b36-e57d-49bb-a021-6ac861bc1825/c14626b0-d94e-11ed-a430-db8c5f970635/file-1lgdwlllo.png?format=png 1500w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/2000/image/1lgdwllln/244f9b36-e57d-49bb-a021-6ac861bc1825/c14626b0-d94e-11ed-a430-db8c5f970635/file-1lgdwlllo.png?format=png 2000w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/2500/image/1lgdwllln/244f9b36-e57d-49bb-a021-6ac861bc1825/c14626b0-d94e-11ed-a430-db8c5f970635/file-1lgdwlllo.png?format=png 2500w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 720px\" decoding=\"async\"></p>\n<p>Acetic anhydride reacts with the alcoholic function group and converts the alcoholic function group into ester functional group. The <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.186ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.76ex\" height=\"1.505ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -583 778 665\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>OH is known as an alcoholic functional group. The <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.186ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.76ex\" height=\"1.505ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -583 778 665\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>OC(O)<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.186ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.76ex\" height=\"1.505ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -583 778 665\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> is known as an ester functional group.</p>\n<p>During the conversion hydrogen of alcoholic group is replaced by CH<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.375ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.988ex\" height=\"1.099ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -320.2 436.6 485.8\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(33,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>CO<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.186ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.76ex\" height=\"1.505ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -583 778 665\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> group of acetic anhydride. The above reaction is known as acetylation because acetyl group CH<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.375ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.988ex\" height=\"1.099ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -320.2 436.6 485.8\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(33,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>CO<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.186ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.76ex\" height=\"1.505ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -583 778 665\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> is attaching with the reactant alcohol.</p>\n<p>So, upon acetylation of cellulose with excess acetic anhydride/H<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.339ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.988ex\" height=\"1.065ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -320.9 436.6 470.9\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(33,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>SO<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.339ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.988ex\" height=\"1.083ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -328.7 436.6 478.7\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(33,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"34\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-34\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> (catalytic) all the <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.186ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.76ex\" height=\"1.505ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -583 778 665\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>OH group will convert into acetyl group.</p>\n<p>As the cellulose contains a large number of glucose units but our product is triacetate. It means the alcohol group of three glucose units of cellulose is converted into acetyl group. As the acetic anhydride is in excess, all alcoholic groups of three glucose units of cellulose will convert into acetyl groups.</p>\n<p>So, the structure of the product is</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1000/image/1lgdwmull/c573eef0-e102-49d7-b64a-6d8fec0689ce/e408c590-d94e-11ed-a430-db8c5f970635/file-1lgdwmulm.png?format=png\" data-orsrc=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/image/1lgdwmull/c573eef0-e102-49d7-b64a-6d8fec0689ce/e408c590-d94e-11ed-a430-db8c5f970635/file-1lgdwmulm.png\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0px auto;max-height:40vh\" alt=\"IIT-JEE 2008 Paper 2 Offline Chemistry - Biomolecules Question 8 English Explanation 3\" srcset=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/500/image/1lgdwmull/c573eef0-e102-49d7-b64a-6d8fec0689ce/e408c590-d94e-11ed-a430-db8c5f970635/file-1lgdwmulm.png?format=png 500w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/750/image/1lgdwmull/c573eef0-e102-49d7-b64a-6d8fec0689ce/e408c590-d94e-11ed-a430-db8c5f970635/file-1lgdwmulm.png?format=png 750w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1000/image/1lgdwmull/c573eef0-e102-49d7-b64a-6d8fec0689ce/e408c590-d94e-11ed-a430-db8c5f970635/file-1lgdwmulm.png?format=png 1000w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1500/image/1lgdwmull/c573eef0-e102-49d7-b64a-6d8fec0689ce/e408c590-d94e-11ed-a430-db8c5f970635/file-1lgdwmulm.png?format=png 1500w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/2000/image/1lgdwmull/c573eef0-e102-49d7-b64a-6d8fec0689ce/e408c590-d94e-11ed-a430-db8c5f970635/file-1lgdwmulm.png?format=png 2000w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/2500/image/1lgdwmull/c573eef0-e102-49d7-b64a-6d8fec0689ce/e408c590-d94e-11ed-a430-db8c5f970635/file-1lgdwmulm.png?format=png 2500w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 720px\" decoding=\"async\"></p>"}]}